window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>“<i>You know you’re in love when you can’t fall asleep because reality is finally better than your dreams.\" - </i>Dr. Seuss</p> <p><b>Book 6: The Human Mate for the Dragon Prince</b></p> <p>This is Anselm and Kayla’s story… an angsty dragon prince, a human with eyes only for him, and the realization that what he’s been looking for is right under his nose all along.</p> <p><b>Book 7: The Prince of Dragon Magic</b></p> <p>This is Anthony and Charity’s story… a dragon prince with a secret, a human woman with strange dreams, and a story of fate that proves love has no bounds.</p> <p><b>Book 8: His Dragon Princess</b></p> <p>This is Iain and Veronica’s story… a cruel dragon shifter, an independent dragon princess, and the struggle to overcome their long-standing rivalry to rescue her fated mate.</p> <p><b>Book 9: The Future King’s Queen</b></p> <p>This is Carlak and Jessa’s story… a handsome dragon prince, a curvy older dragon princess, and the explosive discovery of their fated mate bond.</p> <p><b>Book 10: The Dragon of Her Dreams</b></p> <p>This is Jaegar’s and Vanya’s story… a bastard dragon prince, an elegant and stoic dragon princess, and their tale of dreams, visions, and true love brought to life.</p>"; 
